# Changelog

Part of the [[README]]. Every change to a rule in this vault gets a dated line here, newest first. Record a change in the same session it's made. Keep each line to one or two sentences. Lines older than 30 days move, word for word, to `Archive/changelog-<YYYY>.md`. Kit changes are in the tidyvault repo; each `copier update` gets a line here with the old and new version ([[procedures]], Update from the kit).

- **[[= '%Y-%m-%d' | strftime =]]** — Vault created from tidyvault [[= _copier_answers._commit | default('dev') =]].
